The '''Celestic Town Historical Research Center''' (Japanese: '''カンナギタウンの{{tt|歴史研究所|れきしけんきゅうしょ}}''' ''Kannagi Town Historical Research Institute'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive building located in [[Celestic Town]] in [[Sinnoh]]. {{an|Cynthia}}'s grandmother, [[Professor Carolina]], is the head of the Research Center while [[Cyrus]] was a donor and funded research for his own exploits. 

[[File:Celestic Museum Inside.png|thumb|220px|left|Inside the Research Center]]
The Research Center was built near the Celestic Ruins, where archaeologists discovered the [[Lustrous Orb]] prior to ''[[DP040|Top-Down Training !]]''. It contains an elaborate library and numerous artefacts related to Sinnoh mythology. Inside the Research Center are stone tablets and the small fresco involving the legend of the {{an|lake guardians}}. Portraits of {{p|Dialga}} and {{p|Palkia}} can also be seen here.

The [[Adamant Orb]] was supposed to be brought to the Research Center from the [[Eterna Historical Museum]] so that the two [[Pokémon of myth orbs]] could be studied together, but it was stolen by [[Team Galactic]] in ''[[DP096|Losing Its Lustrous!]]''. Team Galactic also stole the Lustrous Orb in ''[[DP097|Double Team Turnover!]]'', and partially destroyed the Celestic Ruins during the heist.

Team Galactic were later disbanded in ''[[DP152|The Battle Finale of Legend!]]'', and the stolen Adamant and Lustrous Orbs were recovered to be put on display at the Celestic Town Historical Research Center.
